s="text-center py-5" style="color:var(--muted)"><i class="bi bi-grid-3x3-gap fs-3 d-block mb-2"></i>No categories yet. Create your first category.</td></tr><?php endif; ?></tbody></table></div><?php if($categories->hasPages()): ?><nav class="p-3 border-top d-flex justify-content-center" aria-label="Category pages"><?php echo e($categories->onEachSide(1)->links()); ?></nav><?php endif; ?></div>
